    <string name="privacy_dialog_title">What happens to your data?</string>
    <string name="privacy_dialog_content">ScamShield is engineered with strict Data Minimization:\n\n• No Background Access: We never read your SMS, contacts, notifications, or call logs.\n• User-Initiated: Only content you explicitly submit is analyzed.\n• Local-First: Heuristics run directly on your device.\n• No Message Retention: Content is never stored on servers or used for model training.\n• Full Control: You can disable history and erase all data anytime with one tap.</string>

